prompt:
A complete 30-second narrative segment, 16:9, sculpted Chinese 3D animated feature style. Woven cloth, dimensional faces, cohesive sculpted hair, restrained wood and bronze. Natural Mandarin dialogue with lip synchronization, footsteps, water and cloth sounds. Each timeline interval is an action beat. Camera cuts follow the CAMERA PLAN; continuous takes carry successive beats through one moving camera. Begin by matching the opening composition in @Image1. Reference portraits define identity and clothing; the current action defines pose and placement. Technical diagrams define mechanical connections translated into the scene materials. Paper surfaces stay suitable for later Chinese typography.
REFERENCE ROLES:
@Image1: opening wooden death-register tag and scraped finger.
@Image2: Lu Zhao 陆照, teal clothes, lower trousers wet, bare palms.
@Image3: Ma Duo 麻铎 identity and wet brown clothing; restraint follows the timeline.
@Image4: Wen Xi 闻溪, mint clothing wet.
@Image5: the grey-bearded rescued worker, distinct from the flashback elder.
@Image6: Ali 阿砾, blue clothes wet.
@Image7: lock chamber: south ladder left, north door right, raised west ledge.
@Image8: inner face of closed north room and inspection opening.
@Image9: same palm-sized copper plate before first thrust.
@Image10: copper left shallow dent after first failed thrust.
@Image11: one ordinary short black awl with old hemp-wrapped grip.
@Image12: Ma Duo fork.
@Image13: small detachable bronze valve crank at Ma Duo waist.
@Image14: small purse and tied strings of copper coins.
@Image15: mechanical connection guide for the winch, rendered as timber and bronze inside the lock chamber.
CAMERA PLAN: At 0s start in the wooden tag detail. At 3s action-cut to the ladder wide view. At 7.5s hard cut inside the flooded locked room. At 10s cut to the first awl attempt. From 12.5s to 30s use one continuous low side tracking take: follow Ma Duo blocking the ladder and Lu Zhao retreating toward the drum, lower gently to reveal the rope loop, stone, pawl and wedge together, then track the purse toss and fork thrust toward the fixed beam. Finish steady on the lodged fork, the awl resting on the ledge and Lu Zhao using the final added half-second to firmly grip the wedge with both hands. The wedge stays seated, rope remains slack and fork stays lodged.
TIMELINE:
[0–3s] A wooden death-register tag fills the frame; the tag carries a blank tracked surface for post-composited name and death entry. Lu Zhao's scraped fingertip presses his name. Then Ma Duo's hand turns the tag away.
[3–7.5s] Lu Zhao descends the south ladder at screen left into ankle-deep water. A raised repair ledge connects the ladder area to the north door at screen right; pounding comes from its high inspection opening. Then the camera tracks with him toward the lit opening; his black awl stays at his belt and his boots and lower tunic become wet.
[3.1–7.1s] 陆照, off-screen voice, says exactly in Mandarin: “二百四十铜，够姐姐歇十二天。”
[7.5–10s] Inside the flooded room, camera faces sideways toward the inspection opening. Wen Xi places the lamp on its inner ledge, a grey-bearded worker holds the jamb and Ali pounds the panel lower down. Then she calls toward the opening; Ali's hand slips down and she turns to support the worker.
[7.6–9.6s] 闻溪, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “三个人！开门！”
[10–12.5s] Side wide view shows Lu Zhao braced at the wooden foot stops, holding the awl in both hands against the door lock. The latch is visible through the inspection opening. Then he thrusts, recoils at a dull impact and draws back; the copper is just dented and the door stays shut.
[12.5–16.5s] Ma Duo steps into the shallow water by the south ladder at screen left; a detached bronze crank hangs from his belt. Then he blocks Lu Zhao's retreat with his fork and drives him toward the south end of the repair ledge beside the winch. The north door remains at screen right.
[12.7–16s] 麻铎, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “省点力气。门不用开了。”
[16.5–19.5s] Ma Duo stands left and Lu Zhao right with the fork between them. Lu Zhao glances toward the trapped people as he speaks. Then Ma Duo answers and presses forward until Lu Zhao's hip meets the winch frame.
[16.6–17.9s] 陆照, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “他们还活着。”
[18–19.3s] 麻铎, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “账上没有。”
[19.5–22.5s] A low wide side angle clearly shows one continuous rope from an open cargo loop in the shallow water over the winch to a stone weight, with a handspan gap above its catch-frame; the projecting brake wedge holds the drum. Lu Zhao at right reaches for his purse. Then Ma Duo's leading foot at left approaches the loop as the north door pounds; his fork targets Lu Zhao above the rope. An existing ratchet pawl rests on the gear back, allowing forward rotation and preventing reverse unwinding.
[22.5–25s] Lu Zhao keeps the awl in his left hand and tosses the small purse with his right during a pounding sound from the door. Then the purse lands inside the cargo loop directly on Ma Duo's forward attack path; Ma Duo glances down at the clink and back at Lu Zhao.
[25–27.5s] Ma Duo keeps the fork aimed at Lu Zhao, steps beyond the purse and brings his rear foot into the broad cargo loop while thrusting. Then Lu Zhao pivots outside the axle frame; the fork travels toward a timber beam separate from the moving drum.
[25.1–26.9s] 麻铎, visible speaker with synchronized lips, says exactly in Mandarin: “这点钱买命？”
[27.5–30s] Lu Zhao slips aside; the fork embeds in a fixed wooden beam beside the winch, with a visible gap between beam and rotating drum. Then Ma Duo grips the shaft to pull it free while Lu Zhao lays the awl sideways on the ledge beside him.
During 29.5–30s, after the awl rests securely, Lu Zhao grips the wedge with both hands. The wedge remains seated, rope stays slack and fork remains lodged in the fixed beam.
Lu Zhao palms remain bare and his shoulder cloth intact. Original short awl at waist or in hands as specified.
The original awl stays a single small hemp-handled tool. All characters preserve their reference identities across camera movements. End at the last specified action state at 30 seconds.
